    "snippet": "- Monsoon storm activity will remain isolated in coverage through Friday before a significant increase in moisture arrives this weekend, promoting cooler temperatures and better overall rain chances. Farther west across SE California and SW Arizona, cloud cover left over from earlier shower activity has stunted warming slightly, but high temperatures are still expected to reach around 110-116 later this afternoon.",
